  "bodyHash": "c19ba34137f32c1e",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1sFio8F.png\" alt=\"Banner\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>Fancy Block Particles</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">是一款僅限客戶端使用的模組，能將原版 Minecraft 中基礎的 2D 粒子轉換為酷炫的<strong>3D 動畫粒子</strong>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組是對 MorphoxL 原版的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-block-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fancy Block Particles</a> 進行全面改版，並已移植至最新版本的 Minecraft。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>模組介紹</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組為遊戲引入了 3D 粒子效果，並提供高度自訂選項以符合您的個人喜好。如果您覺得某些粒子效果不理想，可以減少其數量或直接關閉。關閉後（透過 FBP 設定面板），遊戲將恢復顯示標準的原版粒子。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>本模組僅需安裝在客戶端即可！</strong></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>是的，您可以將其加入自己的模組整合包中使用！</strong></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>粒子與動畫效果</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>方塊放置動畫與破壞粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H0q8pHN.gif\" alt=\"Block breaking\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>火焰、熔岩、煙霧與營火煙霧粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JcIIAkj.gif\" alt=\"Flame and smoke\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>螢火蟲粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0xYnkah.gif\" alt=\"Firefly\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>滴水粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/24RpkCg.gif\" alt=\"Drip\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>降雨粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7VDUAkF.gif\" alt=\"Rain\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>降雪粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x5NnVa7.gif\" alt=\"Snow\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>設定選項</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FBP 允許您根據個人偏好自訂核心的破壞粒子設定。要開啟 FBP 設定面板，請按下鍵盤上的 <strong>I</strong> 鍵（預設值）。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RPdhY21.png\" alt=\"Menu\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需更進階的調整，您也可以直接修改位於 <strong><em>config/fbp/config.json</em></strong> 的設定檔。</span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>快捷鍵設定</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟用/停用模組&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未設定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟用/停用放置動畫&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未設定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開啟設定面板&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>I</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">切換凍結特效&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>R</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">清除粒子&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未設定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速將方塊加入黑名單&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>X</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速將手持方塊加入黑名單&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong>Shift + X</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">重新載入設定&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未設定</strong></span></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>OptiFine / Iris 相容性</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FBP <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">應該能</span>與 OptiFine 和 Iris 正常相容。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若您發現在使用 FBP 搭配 OptiFine、Iris 或其他光影模組時出現專屬錯誤，請在此 <a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles/issues/new?labels=bug&template=bug_report.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報</a>。<strong>不過</strong>請注意，並非所有此類問題都能夠解決！</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>下載連結</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.21.11&showAlphaFiles=show\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.16.5</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若需下載舊版本或原始模組，請前往 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-block-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>貢獻與反饋</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>發現錯誤了嗎？</strong> 請在此 <a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles/issues/new?labels=bug&template=bug_report.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報</a>，我會盡力修復！</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>有新功能的構想嗎？</strong> 歡迎在此 <a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles/issues/new?labels=enhancement&template=feature_request.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">提出建議</a>！</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>原始碼</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點我</a>查看</span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>原始碼</strong>！<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#333;font-size:14px\">「如果您想使用我的程式碼，請隨意使用，但請務必註明原作者是誰！」</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#333;font-size:14px\">祝順心，作者敬上。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>支援作者</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fhantonik\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.buymeacoffee.com/button-api/?text=Buy me a coffee&emoji=&slug=hantonik&button_colour=BD5FFF&font_colour=ffffff&font_family=Comic&outline_colour=000000&coffee_colour=FFDD00\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>我純粹出於熱情開發此模組</strong>，但如果您想支持我的工作，可以 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fhantonik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">請我喝杯咖啡</a>，<strong>感謝您 &lt;3</strong>！</p>",
